;; SSS-STRIPING-PLAN
;; Striping line types from LA plan sets (Westwood signing and striping, 2025). Units: feet, true length. LTSCALE 1 and PSLTSCALE 0 so stripe and gap lengths read true in model space.
;; SoCal Super Standards. Load with LINETYPE > Load > File.

*LANELN,Lane line 7 ft stripe 17 ft gap
A,7,-17
*2WLTL,TWLTL and 45 mph line 12 ft stripe 36 ft gap
A,12,-36
*BIKELN,Bike lane line 4 ft stripe 8 ft gap
A,4,-8
*CATTRK,Cat track 2 ft stripe 8 ft gap
A,2,-8
*ELETRK,Dotted extension 3 ft stripe 12 ft gap
A,3,-12
*R-SOLID,Remove solid striping
A,2,-3
*R-LANELN,Remove broken lane line
A,1.4,-1.4,1.4,-1.4,1.4,-17
*R-2WLTL,Remove two-way left-turn lane line
A,2,-1.33,2,-1.33,2,-1.33,2,-36
*R-BIKELN,Remove bike lane line
A,1,-0.5,1,-0.5,1,-8
*R-CATTRK,Remove cat track
A,0.4,-1.2,0.4,-8
*R-ELETRK,Remove elephant track
A,0.75,-1.5,0.75,-12
